<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  OWASP Dependency Check suppression file.
  Every entry must name: the CVE, the affected jar, a written justification,
  and an expiry date (after which the suppression must be re-evaluated).
  Never suppress without a comment explaining why the risk is acceptable.
  Requirement: Security steering — pin versions, run a vulnerability check in CI.
-->
<suppressions xmlns="https://jeremylong.github.io/DependencyCheck/dependency-suppression.1.3.xsd">

  <!--
    FALSE POSITIVE — CVE-2025-7962 on angus-activation
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
    CVE:         CVE-2025-7962
    Jar:         org.eclipse.angus:angus-activation (any version)
    CVSS:        7.5 as reported by the scan — SMTP injection via CR/LF in mail fields
    Reported by: OWASP Dependency Check via CPE cpe:/a:eclipse:angus_mail

    Why this is a false positive:
    The vulnerability is in the angus-mail SMTP implementation, not in
    angus-activation. angus-activation is the Jakarta Activation Framework
    implementation (file type detection); it contains no mail transport code
    and cannot perform SMTP injection. The OWASP DC scanner incorrectly maps
    angus-activation to the angus_mail CPE because both share the Eclipse
    Angus project namespace.

    Evidence: the CVE record (https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-7962)
    describes an SMTP injection in the Jakarta Mail SMTP transport
    (org.eclipse.angus:smtp), not in the activation framework. The CVSS
    score shown by the scan (7.5) may differ from other scorings of the same CVE.
    The local suppression is limited to this jar and this CPE.

    chat-ledger does not send email of any kind, so even the real angus-mail
    vulnerability would not be reachable. angus-activation is a transitive
    dependency pulled in by the Jakarta EE stack; it is not called directly.

    Expiry: 2027-06-01 — re-evaluate when upgrading Dependency Check or
    when angus-activation is next upgraded.
    ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  -->
  <suppress base="true">
    <notes><![CDATA[
      FALSE POSITIVE: CVE-2025-7962 affects the Jakarta Mail SMTP transport
      (angus-mail), not angus-activation. Expires 2027-06-01.
    ]]></notes>
    <packageUrl regex="true">^pkg:maven/org\.eclipse\.angus/angus-activation@.*$</packageUrl>
    <cpe>cpe:/a:eclipse:angus_mail</cpe>
  </suppress>

</suppressions>
